sequenceDiagram
    participant Bootstrap as MapScenarioBootstrapPIBT
    participant Agent as GridEnemyAgentPIBT
    participant Path as GridPIBTPathfinder
    participant Planner as PIBTPlanner
    participant Runtime as Enemy Runtime

    Bootstrap->>Planner: Initialize grid
    Bootstrap->>Agent: Spawn enemy
    Agent->>Planner: Register agent

    loop Replan tick
        Agent->>Path: TryFindPath
        Path->>Planner: FrankWolfe
        Planner-->>Path: Path result
        Path-->>Agent: Path
        Agent->>Runtime: Follow path
        opt Threat found
            Agent->>Runtime: Shoot or recover
        end
    end
